{
 "esm": "1.3.0",
 "metadata": {
  "name": "cam_physics_update",
  "description": "The physics_update state law of the CAM6 physics (stage 2 of the EqESM project; components/cam/src/physics/cam/physics_types.F90:207-495 of the instrumented cam6_4_212 fork, SCAM run C_JRA_t62_scam_inst, all 48 steps of the dump window, dt = 1800 s). The law is the single state-update step applied after EVERY parameterization: it applies the ptend (already pre-scaled by 1/3 inside the CLUBB/MG2 macro-micro loop) to the state \u2014 u/v, the 34 constituents through one index-set equation over [lev, cnst] (qraw = q + win*ptend_q*dt computed once, then the qneg3 qmin floor or the number-concentration min/max clamp via the constituent_update template, F90:313-334), the CLDLIQ/CLDICE state_cnst_min_nz 1e-36 zeroing at the convect_deep/zm_conv_tend sites (F90:353-375, the state_cnst_min_nz_mask template applied to the CLDLIQ and CLDICE columns of the post-clamp q, with the [cnst]-shaped pair masks zeroing CLDLIQ/NUMLIQ and CLDICE/NUMICE together), T via ptend_s*dt/cpairv (F90:415-421, cpairv = cpair because dry_air_species = ''), and the hydrostatic geopotential recompute with the virtual-temperature chain of geopotential_temp.F90:133-216 (non-lagrangian branch: hkl = pdel/pmid; the lagrangian piln branch and the WACCM-X H/H2 caps and cam_thermo_dry_air_update are not exercised by this run and are not transcribed) \u2014 and it accumulates the tendencies into tend%dudt/dvdt/dtdt (F90:287-301, 417-419), pinned as a multi-site sum over the consecutive bc-phase call sites by the TendAccumulation model in this file. tend%flx_net is NOT touched by physics_update (it is accumulated in physpkg.F90:1527/3048 outside the law). The model's lev axis is SURFACE-FIRST (index 1 = the surface layer = dump lev 32, the orientation of the EarthSciDiscretizations column_nonuniform_1d grid whose cumulative-integral rules lower the hydrostatic sums), so every [lev] test array is the dump's lev-1..32 column reversed. The cnst axis is the dump's pcnst order (34 constituents: Q, CLDLIQ, CLDICE, NUMLIQ, NUMICE, RAINQM, SNOWQM, NUMRAI, NUMSNO, then the aerosol/chem species bc_a1..SOAG in the dump's column order), 1-based; the constituent-dependent equations refer to it only through the [cnst]-shaped parameter tables (lq, qmin, num_clamp, wet_mask, cld_min_nz, pair masks) and the two constant column selections CLDLIQ = 2 and CLDICE = 3. The geopotential integrals are written as `integral` and lowered by the imported integral_lev_cumulative_from_bottom / integral_lev_nodes_cumulative_from_bottom rules with the dz = pdel/pmid measure and z_sfc = 0. Tests pin the law at the convect_deep call site on ZM-active steps only (18 and 40, one from each active block; steps 1-17/24-39/41-48 are inactive with all-zero ptends), at levels where the ptends are nonzero (dump lev 15..32), plus clubb#1, microp#1, aero_calcsize, radiation and vdiff (chained to the next call site's dump rows: convect_shallow, microp#1, clubb#2, aero_wetdep, aoa_tracers, gw), and the tend accumulation of the whole tphysbc phase as a multi-site sum against cam_tend_total.csv. Gaps documented in README-cam-physics-update.md: the ac-phase dtdt carries the SE dycore scaling cpairv/cp_or_cv_dycore (physpkg.F90:2026-2030) outside this law, the sslt_rebin_adv sea-salt mutation between convect_shallow and ssatcontrail, the dump's 3-digit-exponent 'E'-dropping quirk, and the qmin provenance (chemistry.F90)."
 },
 "index_sets": {
  "lev": {
   "kind": "interval",
   "size": "NLEV"
  },
  "lev_nodes": {
   "kind": "interval",
   "size": {
    "op": "+",
    "args": [
     "NLEV",
     1
    ]
   }
  },
  "cnst": {
   "kind": "interval",
   "size": "NCNST"
  },
  "site": {
   "kind": "interval",
   "size": "NSITE"
  }
 },
 "metaparameters": {
  "NLEV": {
   "type": "integer",
   "default": 32,
   "description": "Number of CAM vertical levels (pver = 32 in this run)."
  },
  "NCNST": {
   "type": "integer",
   "default": 34,
   "description": "Number of advected constituents pcnst = 34 in this run, in the dump's column order."
  },
  "NSITE": {
   "type": "integer",
   "default": 15,
   "description": "Number of consecutive tphysbc physics_update call sites summed by the TendAccumulation test (energy_fixer, dadadj, convect_deep, convect_shallow, ssatcontrail, clubb#1..3, microp#1..3, aero_calcsize, aero_wetdep, convect_deep_2, radiation)."
  }
 },
 "models": {
  "PhysicsUpdate": {
   "expression_templates": {},
   "expression_template_imports": [
    {
     "ref": "./cam_templates.esm"
    },
    {
     "ref": "${ESD_ROOT}/grids/column_nonuniform_1d/rules/integral_lev_cumulative_from_bottom.esm",
     "bindings": {
      "NLEV": "NLEV"
     }
    },
    {
     "ref": "${ESD_ROOT}/grids/column_nonuniform_1d/rules/integral_lev_nodes_cumulative_from_bottom.esm",
     "bindings": {
      "NLEV": "NLEV"
     }
    }
   ],
   "variables": {
    "rair": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "J/(kg*K)",
     "default": 287.0423113650487,
     "description": "dry-air gas constant rair = SHR_CONST_RDAIR = AVOGAD*BOLTZ/MWDAIR (physconst.F90:102, shr_const_mod.F90:46-48), [J/(kg K)]; the gas constant of the hydrostatic rog = rairv/gravit."
    },
    "gravit": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m/s^2",
     "default": 9.80616,
     "description": "standard gravity g = SHR_CONST_G (physconst.F90:106, shr_const_mod.F90:51-54), [m/s^2]."
    },
    "cpair": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "J/(kg*K)",
     "default": 1004.64,
     "description": "specific heat of dry air cpair = SHR_CONST_CPDAIR (physconst.F90:99, shr_const_mod.F90:58-59), [J/(kg K)]; cpairv = cpair because dry_air_species = '' (air_composition.F90:354)."
    },
    "rh2o": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "J/(kg*K)",
     "default": 461.5046398201599,
     "description": "water-vapor gas constant rh2o = SHR_CONST_RWV (shr_const_mod.F90:44-45), [J/(kg K)]; feeds zvir = rh2o/rair - 1 (SHR_CONST_ZVIR)."
    },
    "z_sfc": {
